  "summary": "Protects block template access in the mining interface with a mutex to prevent concurrent IPC threads from racing on template data. Caches total fees directly on CBlockTemplate and exposes a getTotalFees() getter so IPC callers do not have to sum transaction fees manually. Refactors WaitAndCreateNewBlock to accept template hash and fee arguments so callers can release the lock before waiting.",
